ine+2012+%28Tocadisco+Remix%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2012 Milk & Sugar Recordings"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 6, "low": 10}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:10:53", "end": "00:13:31", "text": "Thank you so much for tuning in. You're here on The Midday Mix. The Midday Mix broadcasts from unceded Gadigal land in so-called Redfern. I wish to pay my respects to Elders Past and Present as well as any First Nation listeners listening in right now. Sovereignty was never ceded. This is, was and always will be Gadigal land. You're on The Midday Mix with Tommy. Jonathan in the mix right now. hello hello it's quite different to what we normally do usually i'm across you but now i'm on the left of you yeah interesting um tell us a little bit about the set what do you got what you got planned for the duration of the hour that you're here with us today yeah so a bit different to um usual usual stuff on mosaic but i'm playing a bit of house deep house electro stuff today um the last kind of big set i played was in nippa luna dark mofo back in june so um a few tracks from my trip over there that i played but also just stuff um i like found when i was there or found from sets around and just general sounds inspired from that trip um such an amazing place and festival and yeah really like was trying to immerse myself in that whole thing and it's really cool to see and learn a lot of the art there and um yeah the whole programming was amazing and just seeing all that so yeah just a bit more down-tempo stuff um good midday vibe i feel that first one was kuniyuki takahashi with night forest and that was his dub version of that um really nice like yeah like percussive track flute and is really nice spacious and yeah more of that to come so it will be here for the duration of an hour it's 12 12 right now we'll be here until 1 p.m we might come in and out of a little chat here and there to keep you company but feel free to text in on 0435 123 945 that's 0435 123 945 let us know if you're enjoying the mix if you have any memories attached to any of the music if you went to dark mofo how was your experience i'm sure it was amazing i wasn't able to be there but i'm sure it was an incredible festival it always is it always looks amazing um but we'll chat in a little bit you're on the midday mix"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Skybus", "artists": [{"name": "Scan00"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:02:07"}, "track": {"title": "Night Forest", "artists": [{"name": "Kuniyuki Takahashi"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:00"}, "track": {"title": "Babarabatiri (Tee's Latin Mix) [Mixed]", "artists": [{"name": "Gypsymen"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:15:00"}, "track": {"title": "Shanti", "artists": [{"name": "Solee"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:16:00"}, "track": {"title": "Last Dance", "artists": [{"name": "Asa Tate"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:17:00"}, "track": {"title": "All I Got (Chris Fortier 20yr Dub)", "artists": [{"name": "Chris Fortier & Neil Kolo"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:20:00"}, "track": {"title": "I Try", "artists": [{"name": "Francois Dubois"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:21:00"}, "track": {"title": "All Stars Return as Reflections", "artists": [{"name": "CosmoSong"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:24:22"}, "track": {"title": "Code Five", "artists": [{"name": "Focura Music"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"ena